contract={'SCHEMA':'H77-02-CLAIM-ONCE-CONTRACT-1','IMPLEMENTED':False,'QUALIFIED':False,'OPERATION':'CLAIM_ONCE(grant, subject, probe)','STABLE_STORE':'One dedicated local filesystem directory under host-capability-verification/h77-02-consumption, actual absolute host path/device/ownership pinned by future host profile. Not /tmp, not campaign-budget.jsonl','STEPS':['Read exact issued grant, separate effective reference, original subject and current authority lifecycle; reject absent/changed/revoked/expired/missing freshness','Verify exact command/environment/binary pins, resources, host profile, input/output and actual permissions without privilege acquisition','Take authority-owner serialized administrative epoch lock; revocation/update uses same protocol. Keep lock through claim and one launch handoff; unsupported lifecycle synchronization denies launch','Compute deterministic key. Resolve trusted pinned store via directory fd with no-follow checks and owner-only access; reject unqualified remote/overlay/replaceable/multiple-instance store','Use openat(dirfd,key.sha256+.claim.json,O_WRONLY|O_CREAT|O_EXCL|O_NOFOLLOW,0600), atomically creating permanent reservation. No exists-then-create admission','Existing pathname of any type, stale lock, partial, conflicting or malformed record means consumed/ambiguous: reject; no repair/reset/removal','Write complete canonical consumption record binding key/identities/state CONSUMED. Check exact write length; flush file/fsync(file), then fsync(store directory)','Trusted independent read-only verifier reopens by descriptor/no-follow, confirms exact identity/bytes/inode and barrier-success evidence; reread alone does not prove crash durability','Only this first claimant may receive one process-local nonserializable launch capability after barrier and verifier success. Recovery readers never mint capabilities from records','Recheck authoritative epoch under same lock and exact invocation; invalidate one-shot capability before spawn. Launch once or fail; release lock only after handoff. Never resubmit capability','Append separately exclusive identity-bearing audit outcomes. Error after claim cannot remove consumption. Record LAUNCHED only from actual process creation evidence, completion only from independent wait/exit evidence'], 'DURABILITY_LAYERS':['exclusive creation','complete write','file fsync','parent directory fsync','independent reread','validated actual filesystem crash-recovery semantics'], 'POWER_LOSS_ASSURANCE':'Not claimed. Launch blocked unless required filesystem ordering/persistence guarantee is independently evidenced. Controlled process-crash testing cannot prove power-loss behavior','ADMINISTRATIVE_SCOPE':'Trusted qualification owner/launcher control; no promise against administrator deletion, filesystem rollback, malicious privileged actor or unauthorized bypass. Such events invalidate environment/authority and deny further launch','CONCURRENCY':['One atomic reservation winner','Other simultaneous/duplicate/process/restart/temp-path requests reject','Winner crash leaves reservation blocked; stale locks never reopen','Missing store after previously activated environment is integrity loss, not fresh authority'],'AUDIT':'Append-only separate claim/launch/outcome evidence pins; claim state remains consumed independent of audit availability','REVOCATION':'Fresh authoritative owner epoch required, deny unknown revocation/expiry. Epoch serialization prevents a separate grant change racing claim/launch within governed protocol','DIRECT_HOST_ENTRY_VERIFIED':False,'FAILURE_POLICY':'Unknown state, permission, fsync, verifier, resource, lifecycle or integrity fails closed; no launch/no retry'}
